			"notes": "# There will be only Holiday upd!\n\nFixed:\n- Thumonomicon crossmod tags.\n- Aether Integration.\n- Wand Focus: Spell in multiplayer https://github.com/AirBurn0/am2playground/issues/34.\n- Some spell craft recipes.\n- Sunstone alloy wand caps (Thaumcraft) now requires nuggets intead of ingots, meaning they got cheaper.\n- Mod dependencies (so Botania integration stop requiring Thaumcraft, etc)\n\nAdded:\n- New spell components (Manabolism (by Hopeosity) - lifetap but no hp, only food, and others (I forgot)).\n- Thaumic  Bases integration: Bracelets.\n- Runic Shield (Thaumcraft) & Phantom Ink (Botania) mechanics to all AM2 armor."
		},
